{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 53, :comments ["<b>And he shall make atonement for the house and it shall be clean.</b> Ramban, of blessed memory, explained that because the punishment of the plague that appears on one's house is not like the punishment of the plague that appears on one's body, Scripture did not require an asham and a chatat; for it is sufficient for him with the atonement that the metzora brings for his purification, which is the birds, the cedar wood, and the hyssop."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:25:23.600909278Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}